flowchart LR
  U[Engineer / Browser] --> CF[CloudFront ESC SIL Dashboard]
  CF --> S3D[(Private S3 Dashboard Bucket)]
  U -->|X-Admin-Token| API[API Gateway HTTP API]
  API --> L[Control Lambda]
  L -->|Start / Stop| EC2X[c7i x86_64 EC2]
  L -->|Start / Stop| EC2A[c8g Graviton4 ARM64 EC2]
  L -->|Run identical SIL workload| SSM[AWS Systems Manager]
  SSM --> EC2X
  SSM --> EC2A

  subgraph SIL[FMVSS 126-inspired ESC SIL workload]
    MAN[Sine-with-Dwell steering\n0.7 Hz + 500 ms dwell]
    CAN[Simulated CAN\nsteering + speed + yaw + lateral acceleration]
    ESC[ESC Controller\ndesired yaw + corrective yaw moment]
    VEH[Simplified nonlinear\nbicycle vehicle model]
    ETH[Simulated Ethernet telemetry\n100 ms binary packets]
    MET[Yaw decay + lateral displacement\npass/fail metrics]
    MAN --> CAN --> ESC --> VEH --> CAN
    VEH --> ETH --> MET
  end

  EC2X --> SIL
  EC2A --> SIL
  EC2X -->|JSON result| S3R[(S3 Results Bucket)]
  EC2A -->|JSON result| S3R
  L --> S3R
  L --> DDB[(DynamoDB Run Metadata)]
  U -->|Poll FMVSS-style + compute results| API
